
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.Asin(Value: number): number`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`float llAsin(float Value);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p class="deprecated-text"><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>Deprecated:  use math.asin because Double precision; fastcall.</span></p>
      <p>  <p>Returns a float that is the arcsine in <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Radians" target="_blank">radians</a> of <b>val</b></p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>float</span></td>
          <td>Value / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/val" target="_blank">val</a></td>
          <td>must fall in the range [-1.0, 1.0]</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>math</li>
        <li>math_trig</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">173</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-mandatory">Use Return</span>
        <span class="attr-label bg-native">Native Coded</span>
        <span class="lua-section attr-label bg-deprecated">Lua Deprecated</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>The returned value is in the range <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PI_BY_TWO" target="_blank">-[PI_BY_TWO</a>, PI_BY_TWO][[1]](#footnote_1), or NaN signifying a complex result when the parameter is out of range.</p>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Triggers a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Error/Math" target="_blank">Math Error</a> for complex results if not compiled in Mono.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`-- Touch the object with this script in it to see the arcsine of random numbers!
function LLEvents.touch_start(events)
    local num = #events
    local r = ll.Frand(2) - 1.0
    ll.OwnerSay("The arcsine of " .. tostring(r) .. " is " .. tostring(ll.Asin(r)))
end
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`// Touch the object with this script in it to see the arcsine of random numbers!
default
{
    touch_start(integer num)
    {
        float r = llFrand(2) - 1.0;
        llOwnerSay("The arcsine of " + (string)r + " is " + (string)llAsin(r));
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
